  "releaseNotes": "* Updated Polyfill version from 9.18.0 to 10.3.0\n* Updated DotExtensions version from 10.0.0 Alpha 6 to 10.2.1\n* Fixed Polyfill showing as a public dependency\n* Updated ``Microsoft.Extensions.Primitives`` version from 10.0.4 to 10.0.6\n- Updated `ImmediateListTakeExtensions` to use extension block\n- Fixed `ImmediateIndexOfExtensions` to check indices for -1\n- Removed unneeded code from `ImmediateCountAtLeastExtensions` and `ImmediateCountAtMostExtensions`\n- Enhanced `ImmediateDuplicatesExtensions` with shared Distinct logic\n- Added XML documentation comments to various extensions\n- Used collection expressions in `ImmediateSegmentIndicesExtensions`\n- Renamed `ImmediateListDistincExtensions` class (fixed typo from \"Distinc\" to \"Distinct\")",
